{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame","title":"def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2798,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:gram-schmidt-bilin]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-field-scalar-products]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame","line":4770,"source":"\\begin{definition}[The Fibrewise Gram--Schmidt Frame]\n\\label{def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame}\n\n\\uses{def:gram-schmidt-bilin, def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed, def:smooth-field-scalar-products}\n\n\n\n\nFor a family $(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)$ of sections, define fibrewise sections $U_j,E_j$\nby\n\\[\nU_j|_x=\\mathrm{GS}_{g_x}(X_1|_x,\\ldots,X_m|_x)_j,\n\\qquad\nE_j|_x=\\frac{U_j|_x}{\\sqrt{|g_x(U_j|_x,U_j|_x)|}}.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[The Fibrewise Gram--Schmidt Frame] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a70736575646f2d6772616d2d7363686d6964742d6672616d65\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Agram-schmidt-bilin\">↗ def:gram-schmidt-bilin</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Agram-schmidt-bilin-normed\">↗ def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-field-scalar-products\">↗ def:smooth-field-scalar-products</a> <p></p>For a family <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(X_1,\\ldots ,X_m)$\">$(X_1,\\ldots ,X_m)$</span> of sections, define fibrewise sections <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U_j,E_j$\">$U_j,E_j$</span> by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  U_j|_x=\\mathrm{GS}_{g_x}(X_1|_x,\\ldots ,X_m|_x)_j, \\qquad E_j|_x=\\frac{U_j|_x}{\\sqrt{|g_x(U_j|_x,U_j|_x)|}}.  \\]\">\\[  U_j|_x=\\mathrm{GS}_{g_x}(X_1|_x,\\ldots ,X_m|_x)_j, \\qquad E_j|_x=\\frac{U_j|_x}{\\sqrt{|g_x(U_j|_x,U_j|_x)|}}.  \\]</span> ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:gram-schmidt-bilin","title":"def:gram-schmidt-bilin","label":"def:gram-schmidt-bilin"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed","title":"def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed","label":"def:gram-schmidt-bilin-normed"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-field-scalar-products","title":"def:smooth-field-scalar-products","label":"def:smooth-field-scalar-products"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","title":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","label":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal","title":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal","label":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram